3ms Round 0). The absolute savings were lower than the plan's estimate of 200-300ms, likely because CPU-side work in the logup kernel setup already provided partial GPU overlap in the original code. The optimization establishes a clean two-phase structure that enables future rayon parallelization of Phase 2 CPU work.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}}}
